text: |-
  Project Constitution
  @ProjectConstitu
  Subscribe
  O ...
  BOMBSHELL:Leaked Audio Proves No Autopsy on Charlie Kirk After
  Assassination -AGAINST STATE LAW!
  Leaked police dispatch audio from the day Charlie Kirk was assassinated
  at Utah Valley University reveals: NO AUTOPSY WAS PERFORMED on his
  body.
  • Listen to the chilling exchange:
  Dispatcher: "He did not go in for an autopsy. Death certificate was
  signed by a doctor at the hospital."
  Officer: "Okay... just do a field sup (supplementary report) documenting
  there is no autopsie."
  WHAT?! A high-profile assassination — gunshot to the neck, suspect
  Tyler Robinson charged with murder - and the #1 piece of evidence
  (Charlie's body) skipped a mandatory autopsy?
  Under Utah Code 526B-8-213, the medical examiner SHALL perform
  an autopsy "to aid in the discovery and prosecution of a crime" &
  "protect an innocent person accused."
  Vet here we arp.
